\newlabel{fig:size}{{3}{8}{Excess divergence over the control \versus parameter count (log scale), per family. Solid lines are whitespace edits, dashed lines punctuation edits, and the dotted vertical line marks 3B. \figleft label flips fall with size for \qwentwo and \llama , while \qwenthree peaks at 4B. \figright code text changes show no downward trend with size. Whitespace lies above punctuation for every family and size.\relax }{figure.caption.9}{}}
